  "reference": "1 Sang'Weli 18",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yonasani na Daūdi kwidima būnwaani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wamala ū kūyomba nū Saulo, ū Yonasani nū Daūdi bidima būnwaani būtī wa kūlekana pyī ī shikū ja būlamu wabo; ū Yonasani ūntogwa ū Daūdi gīt'ūmo walī witogelilwe we ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūfuma lūshikū lwenūlo ū Saulo ūnsola ū Daūdi ūbiza wa ha ng'wakwe, atanzunīlīgije ū kūshoka kaya ū kūlī ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani nū Daūdi būbeeja ilagane biyilahīlīla, nguno ū Yonasani akantogwa no ū Daūdi gīt'ūmo walī witogelilwe wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yonasani wīzuula ī ng'hanjo īyo walī azwalile ūng'winha Daūdi, nī lishaati, pyī nū lūshū nū nshipi gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūyūntūma ū Daūdi, wakīīta yawiza būlī kwene, nose ūntūūla kūbiza higūlya ya mabità ga bashilikale; ū mhayo gwenūyo gūūbayeja pye a banhū na a batūmami ba ng'wa Saulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūnkolwa Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho balīshoka kaya, numho ū Daūdi wamalile kūlībūlaga ī Līfilisiti, a bakīma bikobya kūfuma mizengo yose ū mu sī ya Isilaeli, kwiza kūnsūūng'wanha ū ntemi Saulo, kūnū bakwīmbaga na kūbina na būyegi, bakūtūlaga na shitumba na kūfuula mbiilūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū bakūbinaga baahelelekeejaga bakwīmbaga būhaya:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūpelana no, ū būhelelekeja wenūbo būminya; wandya kwiganika, “Ū Daūdi bang'wisaabīla makūmi ga maashihūmbī, alīyo ū nene baagelela maashihūmbī dūhū! Numho apandīke na kī hangī lūūlū ūlū ītī būtemi dūhū?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū kūfuma ikanza lyenīlo ū Saulo wandya kūnola ū Daūdi na liso lya wilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha lūshikū lwa ntondo yaho ū Saulo walī mu kaya, kwimanīla moyo gwabūbi kūfuma kūlī Mulungu gūng'wizīīla na nguzu ningī no. Wandya kūyombagīla mihayo gītī akūhangaga, ū Daūdi nang'hwe wandya kwītūla ī ndono yakwe gīt'ūmo wītīlaga na kale. Ū Saulo walī na'ichimu ū mu nkono gwakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūlīponya ū kūlī Daūdi akwiwīlaga, “Namambe lya kūjūpulukanīja na kū ndugu.” Alīyo ū Daūdi ūshisha ng'hangala ibīlī akūng'wiligaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūng'ogoha ū Daūdi, nguno ūbona hape gīkī ū SEEBA walī hamò nū Daūdi, alīyo ū wei ū SEEBA walī wamala kūneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūng'wīnja ū Daūdi a henaho, ūntūūla būtaale higūlya ya bashilikale shihūmbī, ū Daūdi ūyūbatongeela a banhū benabo ū mu makanza ga būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī īyo wīyītaga yajaga chiza,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yajaga chiza:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, wayītaga mu masala.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nguno ū SEEBA walī hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ongeja ū kūng'ogoha ū Daūdi aho wabona ūmo gwabeelaga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gwabeelaga:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nuūūlū, wītaga na masala.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " būlī gwene ūyo wagwītaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo pye a Baisilaeli na a banhū ba Yuda bongeja ū kūntogwa, nguno wabatongeelaga chiza ū mu makanza ga būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Ūūyū aha nshīke wane ū ntaale ū Melabu, nakūkwinha abize nke wako; ū bebe idadīlage dūhū ūbūlwe ū būlūgū bo ng'wa SEEBA kūlwa nguno yane.” Ū Saulo wiwīlaga, “Natizūnkuumya na nkono gwane ū nene, nabalekele Bafilisiti bakūmūlaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Saulo, “Ū nene nalī nani, nūūlū a bang'wise, a ba lūdūgū lo ng'wa baba ba nani, nose nigeleelwe kūbiza nkwīlīma wa ntemi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike aho lyashika ī likanza lya ng'wa Daūdi kwinhwa ū Melabu gīkī abize nke, ū nshīke ng'wenūyo ūtoojiwa kūlī Adilieli muna Mehola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūntoola ng'wana Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū nshīke o ng'wa Saulo ū Mikali walī antogilwe ū Daūdi, a banhū aho bang'wīla ū mhayo gwenūyo ū Saulo ūtogwa no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiganika, “Nakūntooja ū ng'wenūyo h'akūbiza lūtu lwa kūngwasha, gūngwīle ū nkono gwa Bafilisiti.” Na lūūlū ū Saulo ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Lelo lūūlū ū lūkangala lwa kabīlī lwenūlū ūkūbiza nkwīlīma wane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo ūbalagīla a batūmami bakwe alībawīla, “Ng'witanagi ha mhūjo ū Daūdi mulūngalūnge nang'hwe mung'wīle gīkī, ‘Bebe ū ntemi akūtogilwe, nīyo na a batūmami bakwe pye bakūtogilwe, byalagwa hoi.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla ū Daūdi ī mihayo yenīyo. Daūdi nang'hwe ūbashokeja alīhaya, “A bing'we angū mmho muliganika gīkī ū kūbiza nkwīlīma wa ntemi gūlī mhayo ndo? Ū nene nalī ng'habi wape, nūūlū kūmanīīka hado dūhū nī chene natamanīīkile!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami bakwe ū Saulo būng'wīla, “Ū Daūdi washosha mihayo yīīyī na yīīyī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūhaya, “Ng'wīlagi ū Daūdi gīkī, ‘Ū ntemi atūhayaga kūkwiwa sabo jose jose, alīyo alītogwa kwenhelwa makoba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
