              "text": "Makoba:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makoba ga kū wīīma mbele.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " igana līmò ga Bafilisiti, amalīlwe shiilī kū banishi bakwe.’” A maganiko ga ng'wa Saulo gaalī ha gīkī ū Daūdi ache mu nzīla ya nkono gwa Bafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami ba ng'wa Saulo aho bang'wīla ū Daūdi ī mihayo yenīyī, gūnyeja ū gwa kūbiza nkwīlīma wa ntemi. Na lūūlū aho lītaalī kūshila ī likanza īlo līkatūūlwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū Daūdi ūbūūka na a banhū bakwe, ūūkabūlaga Bafilisiti magana abīlī, ūgatīna a makoba gabo, ūgenha gīkī abize nkwīlīma wa ntemi; wiza ūng'winha ū ntemi a gose gīt'ūmo walī wahayīla. Na ng'hana ū Saulo ūntooja ū Daūdi ū nshīkwe wakwe ū Mikali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Saulo aho wabona, hama witegeleja hape gīkī ū SEEBA walī hamò nū Daūdi, nī gīkī ū nshīke wakwe ū Mikali walī antogilwe ū Daūdi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akongeja ū kūng'ogoha ū Daūdi, ūng'wisaaba kūbiza ng'wanishi wakwe shikū jose ja būlamu wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bataale ba mabità ga Bafilisiti nabo bongeja kūmaniza kūbikoloosha gīkī balwe būlūgū. Alīyo būl'ikanza ūlū biza, ū Daūdi wapandīkaga būtindi būtaale kūtinda a batūmami ba ng'wa Saulo a bangī; na lūūlū ī lina lyakwe lyongeja kūkumūka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
